      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Alert Discussion (Collaboration Panel)",
      "id": "discussion",
      "intro": "Tab Discussion adalah ruang kolaborasi real-time bergaya messenger (mirip WhatsApp) di mana para investigator dapat berdiskusi, berbagi temuan, dan melampirkan file bukti terkait alert fraud.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Antarmuka Chat & Panel Partisipan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tampilan menggunakan background doodle yang modern\n• Header chat menampilkan nama `Discussion` beserta tombol search dan panel partisipan\n• **Panel Partisipan:** Dapat di-toggle (muncul di sisi kanan) untuk melihat daftar analis yang sedang online atau ditugaskan memantau alert ini.\n• Setiap pesan memiliki avatar, nama pengirim, timestamp, dan dibedakan warnanya (pesan Anda di sisi kanan, pesan orang lain di kiri).",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;height:240px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;z-index:10;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#e0f2fe;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Discussion</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">3 Active Participants</div></div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;background:#e2e8f0;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#cbd5e1;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border-top-left-radius:2px;max-width:80%;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;\">Saya cek UTRNNO ini ada anomali lokasi IP dengan terminalnya.</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:4px;text-align:right;\">10:45</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;flex-direction:row-reverse;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#3b82f6;flex-shrink:0;\"></div><div style=\"background:#3b82f6;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:2px;max-width:80%;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#fff;\">Setuju, tolong siapkan action request buat block kartunya.</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#bfdbfe;margin-top:4px;text-align:right;\">10:47</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"width:180px;background:#fff;border-left:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:16px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px;\">Members on Duty</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#3b82f6;border:2px solid #bfdbfe;\"></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Admin</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Owner</div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#cbd5e1;\"></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Checker 1</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Participant</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Melampirkan Bukti (Attachment)",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Format Didukung:** Gambar (JPG/PNG), PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint\n• **Limit Ukuran:** Maksimal 3MB per file.\n• **Cara Upload:** \n  1. Klik tombol penjepit kertas (attach) di sebelah input teks.\n  2. Bisa juga dengan cara **Drag & Drop** file langsung ke area chat panel (layar akan menampilkan dropzone overlay).\n• File gambar akan di-preview otomatis, file dokumen bisa diunduh oleh anggota lain.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(16,185,129,.15);border:1px solid #bbf7d0;background:#fff;padding:16px;\"><div style=\"border:2px dashed #6ee7b7;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#d1fae5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/><polyline points=\"17 8 12 3 7 8\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"15\"/></svg></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#065f46;\">Drag files here or click to select</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#059669;\">Each file should not exceed 3MB (Image, PDF, Word, Excel)</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Optimistic UI & Pengiriman Pesan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Optimistic Chat:** Pesan yang Anda ketik dan kirim akan langsung muncul di layar tanpa menunggu respons lambat dari server.\n• **Indikator Status (WhatsApp style):**\n  - Ikon jam (clock) berdenyut: Pesan sedang dikirim (Sending)\n  - Ikon centang (check): Pesan berhasil terkirim ke server (Sent)\n  - Ikon silang (X) merah: Pesan gagal terkirim (Error)",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(245,158,11,.15);border:1px solid #fde68a;background:#fff;padding:16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:flex-end;\"><div style=\"background:#3b82f6;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:2px;max-width:80%;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#fff;\">Pesan sedang dikirim...</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:4px;margin-top:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#bfdbfe;\">10:50</div><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"background:#3b82f6;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border-top-right-radius:2px;max-width:80%;\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#fff;\">Pesan berhasil dikirim!</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:4px;margin-top:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#bfdbfe;\">10:51</div><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Fitur Search Chat",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik ikon pencarian (kaca pembesar) di header untuk membuka overlay pencarian.\n• Ketik kata kunci, teks pada chat yang relevan akan di-highlight berwarna kuning.\n• Gunakan tombol navigasi naik/turun untuk melompat ke pesan yang mengandung kata kunci tersebut.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(139,92,246,.15);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;background:#f8fafc;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;\"><div style=\"flex:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;\">fraud</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><button style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">↑</button><button style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">↓</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:16px;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;\">Transaksi ini memiliki pola yang identik dengan kasus <mark style=\"background:#fef08a;padding:0 2px;border-radius:2px;\">fraud</mark> minggu lalu.</div></div></div></div>"
